K4|claim|the language server|we_debug.c|E_LSP_BUSY_FMT|1|the refusal said while the language server still answers
K4|claim|the language server|we_debug.c|E_LSP_START_WAIT_FMT|1|the language server's start waiting line
K4|claim|the language server|we_debug.c|E_LSP_WAIT_FMT|1|the language server's answer waiting line
K4|claim|scala-cli setup|we_debug.c|E_SCALA_SETUP_LINE|1|the setup's waiting line, and the refusal said when it is asked again
K4|loop|WpeHandleFileManager|we_fl_unix.c|WpeDrawFileManager|2|the File Manager's own bar hints: Esc leaves it
K4|word|e_pr_ed_beispiel|we_opt.c|e_pr_ed_beispiel|1|an example line drawn in a dialog, not a promise of this editor
K4|claim|the build|we_prog.c|E_BUILD_BUSY_LINE|1|the refusal of a second build, said from any window
K4|claim|the build|we_prog.c|E_BUILD_WAIT_FMT|1|the build's waiting line in Messages
